  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Inclusion Project Phase 2:  Mandera, Garissa, Tana River, Isiolo and Marsabit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide a vital bridge toward the Government of Kenya&#x2019;s (GoK) full ownership and implementation of the national Economic Inclusion Programme (EIP) under KSEIP II. The project will reinforce GoK leadership in delivering integrated social and economic protection services across Garissa, Isiolo, Mandera, Marsabit, and Tana River counties. It will also extend targeted support to the Shirika Plan within the Dadaab refugee settlements and surrounding host communities, ensuring that vulnerable populations are included in pathways to resilience and self-reliance.</narrative>
  </description>
